"The original enrollment key is unavailable. Recovery cannot replace it." = "Urufunguzo rwakoreshejwe mu kwandikisha isura bwa mbere ntiruboneka. Kugarura konti ntibishobora kurusimbura.";
"The original face-verification key is unavailable. Enrollment recovery cannot create a replacement key." = "Urufunguzo rwa mbere rwo kugenzura isura ntiruboneka. Kugarura iyandikwa ry’isura ntibishobora gukora urufunguzo rwo kurusimbura.";
