"The original recovery device key is missing. Keep your private backup and recovery status; this request cannot replace its key." = "Urufunguzo rw’igikoresho rwakoreshejwe bwa mbere mu kugarura konti ntiruboneka. Bika kopi yawe y’ingoboka y’ibanga n’amakuru y’uko kugarura konti bihagaze; ubu busabe ntibushobora gusimbuza urufunguzo rwabwo.";
