"The result is not confirmed. Check the original request before trying again." = "Igisubizo ntikiraremezwa. Reba ubusabe bwabitswe mbere yo kongera kugerageza.";
"The saved account and original device key are retained. Status cannot sign you in, and another account will not start automatically." = "Konti yabitswe n’urufunguzo rwa mbere rw’igikoresho biracyabitswe. Kureba uko bihagaze ntibishobora kukwinjiza muri konti, kandi indi konti ntizatangizwa ku buryo bwikora.";
"The saved photo changed. Its original upload cannot use different bytes." = "Ifoto yabitswe yarahindutse. Ubusabe bwa mbere bwo kuyohereza ntibushobora gukoresha bayiti zitandukanye.";
"The saved photo is unavailable. Keep this upload's status; its bytes cannot be replaced." = "Ifoto yabitswe ntiboneka. Bika amakuru y’uko kuyohereza bihagaze; bayiti zayo ntizishobora gusimburwa.";
"The saved recovery device key is unavailable." = "Urufunguzo rw’igikoresho rwabitswe rwo kugarura konti ntiruboneka.";
