"The saved selfie is unavailable or changed. Check the original capture status before retaking it." = "Ifoto y’isura yawe yabitswe ntiboneka cyangwa yarahindutse. Reba uko kuyifata bwa mbere bihagaze mbere yo kongera kuyifata.";
"The selfies were not clear enough. Hold the phone steady, use even lighting, and retake them." = "Amafoto y’isura yawe ntiyagaragaraga neza bihagije. Fata telefoni utayinyeganyeza, ukoreshe urumuri rungana kandi wongere uyafate.";
"The server cannot resolve this receipt. It may be unknown, expired or revoked. This does not mean the account was deleted. Your receipt is kept; a new account will not start automatically." = "Seriveri ntishobora kubona igisubizo cy’iyi nyandiko. Ishobora kuba itazwi, yararengeje igihe cyangwa yarahagaritswe. Ibi ntibivuze ko konti yasibwe. Inyandiko yawe irabitswe; konti nshya ntizatangizwa ku buryo bwikora.";
"The server confirmed account erasure and private-file cleanup. Previously downloaded or forwarded copies cannot be recalled." = "Seriveri yemeje ko konti yasibwe n’amadosiye y’ibanga akurwaho. Kopi zamaze gukururwa cyangwa kohererezwa abandi ntizishobora kugaruzwa.";
"The server confirmed that this guest account and its private files were deleted. Start again only if you want a new guest account." = "Seriveri yemeje ko iyi konti y’umushyitsi n’amadosiye yayo y’ibanga byasibwe. Tangira bushya gusa niba ushaka konti nshya y’umushyitsi.";
"The server has not yet confirmed removal of all private reference bytes. Keep this saved action and check again; re-enrollment remains unavailable until cleanup is verified." = "Seriveri ntiremeza ko bayiti zose z’amakuru y’isura abitswe mu ibanga zakuweho. Bika iki gikorwa cyabitswe wongere urebe uko gihagaze; kongera kwandikisha isura ntibishoboka kugeza seriveri yemeje ko ayo makuru yakuweho.";
"The server must confirm completed deletion before starting again." = "Seriveri igomba kwemeza ko gusiba byarangiye mbere yo gutangira bushya.";
"The server reported a failure. Private-file cleanup has not been confirmed. Keep this receipt and check the status again." = "Seriveri yatangaje ko igikorwa cyanze. Gukuraho amadosiye y’ibanga ntibiraremezwa. Bika iyi nyandiko wongere urebe uko bihagaze.";
"The service could not allow this action (%@)." = "Serivisi ntiyashoboye kwemerera iki gikorwa (%@).";
"The service returned an unverified result. Nothing has been confirmed." = "Serivisi yagaruye igisubizo kitagenzuwe. Nta kintu kiraremezwa.";
"The seven-day approval window ended before erasure. This is not completed deletion. Resume setup checks the original guest account; it never creates a replacement." = "Igihe cy’iminsi irindwi cyo kwemeza cyarangiye mbere y’uko gusiba bikorwa. Ibi ntibivuze ko gusiba byarangiye. Gukomeza gushyiraho konti bigenzura konti y’umushyitsi ya mbere; ntibikora iyo kuyisimbura.";
"The shutter in this preview collects three sample steps from an included photo. Camera access and face processing are not connected." = "Akabuto ko gufotora muri iki cyitegererezo gakusanya intambwe eshatu z’urugero zivuye mu ifoto irimo. Gukoresha kamera no gutunganya isura ntibihujwe na serivisi.";
"The support website is unavailable in this build." = "Urubuga rw’ubufasha ntiruboneka muri iyi verisiyo.";
"The upload failed on the server. Keep this photo and review its current processing status." = "Kohereza byanze kuri seriveri. Bika iyi foto urebe uko kuyitunganya bihagaze ubu.";
"These captures exceed the 8 MiB enrollment limit. Start again with smaller camera captures." = "Aya mafoto arengeje ingano ntarengwa ya 8 MiB yo kwandikisha isura. Tangira bushya ukoresheje amafoto mato yafashwe na kamera.";
"This Lovelies link is expired or unavailable." = "Igihe cy’iri huza rya Lovelies cyarangiye cyangwa ntiriboneka.";
"This Lovelies link is unavailable." = "Iri huza rya Lovelies ntiriboneka.";
"This account cannot resume while its deletion outcome is unresolved." = "Iyi konti ntishobora gukomeza igihe ibisubizo by’ubusabe bwo kuyisiba bitarakemuka.";
"This account update is unavailable. Open your notification inbox." = "Aya makuru mashya ya konti ntabonetse. Fungura ubutumwa bw’imenyesha wakiriye.";
"This capture has not been confirmed. Check the saved request before taking another selfie." = "Iyi foto yafashwe ntiraremezwa. Reba ubusabe bwabitswe mbere yo gufata indi foto y’isura yawe.";
"This device" = "Iki gikoresho";
"This device could not create its protected verification key." = "Iki gikoresho nticyashoboye gukora urufunguzo rwacyo rurinzwe rwo kugenzura isura.";
"This device has a retained face-verification key but its recovery record is unavailable. A replacement account cannot be created automatically." = "Iki gikoresho kiracyabitse urufunguzo rwo kugenzura isura ariko inyandiko yo kugarura konti ijyanye na rwo ntiboneka. Konti yo gusimbura iyabanje ntishobora gukorwa ku buryo bwikora.";
"This device retains another account's identity. Recovery cannot overwrite it." = "Iki gikoresho kiracyabitse amakuru y’iranga ry’indi konti. Kugarura konti ntibishobora kuyasimbuza.";
"This format needs conversion to JPEG, PNG or WebP before importing." = "Iyi miterere y’ifoto isaba kubanza kuyihindura JPEG, PNG cyangwa WebP mbere yo kuyinjiza.";
"This frontend preview includes still thumbnails. Video playback will connect to your library in the next implementation stage." = "Iki cyitegererezo cy’imigaragarire kirimo amashusho mato adakina. Gukina videwo bizahuzwa n’ububiko bwawe bw’amafoto mu cyiciro gikurikira cyo gushyira porogaramu mu bikorwa.";
"This frontend preview uses included photos." = "Iki cyitegererezo cy’imigaragarire gikoresha amafoto arimo.";
"This is a frontend preview. Sample captures, matching, uploads, sharing, sign-in and account settings stay local. Nothing is sent to a backend or another person." = "Iki ni icyitegererezo cy’imigaragarire. Ingero zo gufata amafoto, guhuza amafoto n’abantu, kohereza, gusangiza, kwinjira muri konti n’igenamiterere rya konti biguma kuri iki gikoresho. Nta cyoherezwa kuri seriveri cyangwa ku wundi muntu.";
"This is a local preview. Your selections stay here when you go back." = "Iki cyitegererezo gikora kuri iki gikoresho gusa. Ibyo watoranyije biguma hano iyo usubiye inyuma.";
"This isn't me" = "Uyu si jye";
"This matched person can share with you. Photo access still needs your review and approval. Blocking excludes them from future matching and sharing." = "Uyu muntu wahujwe n’amafoto ashobora kuyagusangiza. Kubona amafoto biracyasaba ko ubanza kuyareba ukabyemeza. Kumukumira bimukura mu bikorwa byo guhuza amafoto n’abantu no gusangiza bizaza.";
"This original exceeds 20 MB. Export a smaller copy before selecting it." = "Iyi foto y’umwimerere irengeje 20 MB. Kuramo kopi ntoya mbere yo kuyihitamo.";
"This person is excluded from future matching and sharing. Unblocking allows future eligibility; it does not restore past access or add them to your current selection." = "Uyu muntu yakuwe mu bikorwa byo guhuza amafoto n’abantu no gusangiza bizaza. Kumukuriraho ikumirwa bituma ashobora kongera kwemererwa mu bizaza; ntibisubizaho uburenganzira bwa kera cyangwa ngo bimwongere mu bo watoranyije ubu.";
"This photo could not be read. Retake it." = "Iyi foto ntiyashoboye gusomwa. Ongera uyifate.";
"This photo failed on the server. Check its status and choose Retry for that photo." = "Gutunganya iyi foto byanze kuri seriveri. Reba uko ihagaze uhitemo kongera kugerageza kuri iyo foto.";
"This photo is too large. Retake it at a smaller size." = "Iyi foto ni nini cyane. Ongera uyifate ku ngano ntoya.";
"This photo/person match is incorrect" = "Iyi foto ntihuye n’uyu muntu";
"This preview can share a text summary of your sample profile and selections. A real account archive is not connected." = "Iki cyitegererezo gishobora gusangiza incamake yanditse y’umwirondoro wawe w’urugero n’ibyo watoranyije. Nta bubiko bw’amakuru ya konti nyayo buhujwe na cyo.";
"This purchase belongs to another Lovelies account. Sign in to the purchasing account before restoring." = "Ibyaguzwe ni iby’indi konti ya Lovelies. Injira muri konti yabiguze mbere yo kubigarura.";
"This reference was removed. Confirm cleanup before enrolling again." = "Aya makuru y’isura yakuweho. Emeza ko kuyakuraho byarangiye mbere yo kongera kwandikisha isura.";
"This request did not complete deletion. Resume setup checks the same guest account and restores it only if the server still accepts its credentials." = "Ubu busabe ntibwarangije gusiba. Gukomeza gushyiraho konti bigenzura ya konti y’umushyitsi kandi bikayigarura gusa niba seriveri ikemera amakuru yayo yo kwinjira.";
"This requests deletion of the guest account created on this device. Setup will pause while the request is checked. Independent review and verified cleanup are required before deletion is complete." = "Ubu busabe busaba gusiba konti y’umushyitsi yakorewe kuri iki gikoresho. Gushyiraho konti bizahagarara by’agateganyo mu gihe ubusabe busuzumwa. Hakenewe isuzuma ryigenga no kwemezwa ko amakuru yakuweho mbere y’uko gusiba birangira.";
"This requests erasure of your account, face profile and retained private photos after review and verified cleanup. Copies already saved or forwarded cannot be recalled. App Store subscriptions must also be cancelled in your Apple Account." = "Ubu busabe busaba gusiba konti yawe, amakuru y’isura n’amafoto y’ibanga abitswe nyuma y’isuzuma no kwemeza ko kuyakuraho byarangiye. Kopi zamaze kubikwa cyangwa kohererezwa abandi ntizishobora kugaruzwa. Ifatabuguzi rya App Store na ryo rigomba guhagarikwa muri Apple Account yawe.";
"This retrieves an account-bound, one-time export. Choose Save to Files in the system share sheet. Keep the saved copy private." = "Ibi bigarura kopi y’amakuru ijyanye gusa n’iyi konti kandi ikururwa rimwe gusa. Hitamo kubika muri Files mu buryo bwa sisitemu bwo gusangiza. Bika iyo kopi mu ibanga.";
