"This selfie did not match your registered face. Take a fresh selfie to try again." = "Iyi foto y’isura yawe ntiyahuye n’isura yawe yanditswe. Fata ifoto nshya y’isura yawe wongere ugerageze.";
"This selfie is too large. Check the saved capture status before retaking it." = "Iyi foto y’isura yawe ni nini cyane. Banza ugenzure uko igikorwa cyabitswe cyo gufata iyi foto gihagaze mbere yo kongera kuyifata.";
"This signer cannot manage a new device key." = "Ubu buryo bwo gushyira umukono w’ikoranabuhanga ntibushobora gucunga urufunguzo rushya rw’igikoresho.";
"This stops pending transfers. Photos already processing stay in your library. Sharing still requires your review and approval." = "Ibi bihagarika kohereza ibitararangira. Amafoto yamaze gutangira gutunganywa aguma mu bubiko bwawe. Gusangiza biracyasaba ko ubanza kubireba ukabyemeza.";
"This subscription is currently unavailable from the App Store." = "Iri fatabuguzi ntiriboneka muri App Store ubu.";
"This switch previews the enabled and disabled interface states. Verification codes and account protection are not connected." = "Aka kabuto kerekana uko imigaragarire iba imeze iyo ubu buryo bukora n’iyo budakora. Kode zo kwemeza n’uburinzi bwa konti ntibihujwe na serivisi.";
