"Share this reference privately with your parent or legal guardian. They need their own registered adult Lovelies account. A reference never gives access to your photos." = "Sangiza iyi nimero umubyeyi cyangwa umwishingizi wawe mu ibanga. Akeneye konti ye ya Lovelies yanditswe y’umuntu mukuru. Iyi nimero ntiha umuntu uburenganzira ku mafoto yawe.";
