"Under 13" = "Munsi y’imyaka 13";
"Use a request reference shared privately by your child. Your own registered account must be adult and eligible. Each selected purpose is a request for independent review, not immediate approval." = "Koresha nimero y’icyifuzo umwana wawe yaguhaye mu ibanga. Konti yawe yanditswe igomba kuba iy’umuntu mukuru wemerewe. Buri ntego uhisemo ni icyifuzo cy’isuzuma ryigenga, si uruhushya ruhita rutangwa.";
