"Your age and privacy" = "Imyaka yawe n’ubuzima bwite";
"Lovelies is for ages 13 and over. You can still manage privacy and account deletion." = "Lovelies igenewe abafite imyaka 13 kuzamura. Uracyashobora gucunga ubuzima bwite no gusaba gusiba konti.";
"Confirm your age range before face setup or photos." = "Emeza icyiciro cy’imyaka yawe mbere yo kwandikisha isura cyangwa gukoresha amafoto.";
"Current guardian approval and independent review are required before face setup or photos." = "Uruhushya rw’umubyeyi rwemewe n’isuzuma ryigenga birakenewe mbere yo kwandikisha isura cyangwa gukoresha amafoto.";
"Your age or guardian approval changed. Refresh its current status before continuing." = "Imyaka yawe cyangwa uruhushya rw’umubyeyi byahindutse. Vugurura imimerere yabyo mbere yo gukomeza.";
"A minor account cannot change itself to an older age range. Contact support for independent review." = "Konti y’umwana ntishobora kwihindurira mu cyiciro cy’imyaka iruta iyo yatanze. Vugana n’abafasha kugira ngo hakorwe isuzuma ryigenga.";
"Use your own registered, eligible adult account to request guardian review." = "Koresha konti yawe yanditswe y’umuntu mukuru wemerewe kugira ngo usabe isuzuma ry’umubyeyi.";
"This account already has an active guardian request. Refresh its status." = "Iyi konti isanzwe ifite icyifuzo cy’umubyeyi kigikora. Vugurura imimerere yacyo.";
"This guardian request is unavailable to your account. Check the reference and current status." = "Iki cyifuzo cy’umubyeyi ntikiboneka kuri konti yawe. Reba nimero n’imimerere yacyo.";
"Your original age request is held privately for recovery. Resolve it before starting another account or face setup." = "Icyifuzo cyawe cy’umwimerere cy’imyaka kibitswe mu ibanga kugira ngo kigaruzwe. Banza ugisuzume mbere yo gutangira indi konti cyangwa kwandikisha isura.";

